DATA
- College football data: Data provided by CollegeFootballData.com (https://collegefootballdata.com).
  Each install uses its owner's own CFBD key and keeps a private cache under data/. Nothing in this
  repository contains CFBD data: the tests and the demo run on a made-up league generated from the shape
  of CFBD's responses, with every name and number invented.
- Weather: the U.S. National Weather Service (https://www.weather.gov), a public service.
- News headlines: the public RSS feeds each install is pointed at, shown as headlines with links.
- Game notes (schemes, availability, depth charts, TV crew, coaches) are written by the owner, or by an AI
  chat the owner asks, and stay on the owner's computer.

